1148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 205 0 R
/T (One major advantage is that the program performs repeated calculations automatically. The user does not need to add five marks manually or calculate the percentage separately. This saves a small amount of time for one result and can save more time if the program is later extended to process multiple students.)
